- (vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha)
- (vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta)
- (operator_available driver_operator_alpha)  Actually predicate is operator_available ?operator_resource - operator_resource. So (operator_available driver_operator_alpha)
